      "description": "Surface tonale fonctionnelle, sans ombre personnalisée.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-notifications\"><h3>Recevoir les alertes sur ce téléphone</h3><button>Activer les notifications</button></section>",
      "css": ".ds-notifications{padding:16px;border-radius:12px;background:#F0F4F4;color:#191C1D;font-family:sans-serif}.ds-notifications h3{font:500 16px/24px sans-serif;letter-spacing:.2px;margin:0}.ds-notifications button{font:500 14px/20px sans-serif;letter-spacing:.1px;cursor:pointer;padding:8px 12px;min-height:48px;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:transparent;color:#006A6A}.ds-notifications button:hover{background:#006a6a14}.ds-notifications button:active{background:#006a6a29}.ds-notifications button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #006A6A;outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
