      "description": "ListItem et séparateur ; le titre, le statut et la date forment la hiérarchie.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-watch\"><span><strong>Promotions PS5 en France</strong><span class=\"ds-watch-status\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 960 960\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M424,664L706,382L650,326L424,552L310,438L254,494L424,664ZM480,880Q397,880 324,848.5Q251,817 197,763Q143,709 111.5,636Q80,563 80,480Q80,397 111.5,324Q143,251 197,197Q251,143 324,111.5Q397,80 480,80Q563,80 636,111.5Q709,143 763,197Q817,251 848.5,324Q880,397 880,480Q880,563 848.5,636Q817,709 763,763Q709,817 636,848.5Q563,880 480,880ZM480,800Q614,800 707,707Q800,614 800,480Q800,346 707,253Q614,160 480,160Q346,160 253,253Q160,346 160,480Q160,614 253,707Q346,800 480,800ZM480,480Q480,480 480,480Q480,480 480,480Q480,480 480,480Q480,480 480,480Q480,480 480,480Q480,480 480,480Q480,480 480,480Q480,480 480,480Z\"/></svg>Actif</span><small>Dernière réussite : 23 oct. 2026 17:05</small></span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 960 960\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M504,480L320,296L376,240L616,480L376,720L320,664L504,480Z\"/></svg></button>",
